    "body": "Let $T: \\mathbb{R} ^2\\rightarrow  \\mathbb{R} ^2$ be the linear transformation for which\n\\[T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix} 1\\\\ 1\\\\\\end{bmatrix}\\right) = \\begin{bmatrix} 3\\\\ 4\\\\\\end{bmatrix} \\textrm{     and     } T\\left(\\begin{bmatrix} -1\\\\ 1\\\\\\end{bmatrix}\\right) = \\begin{bmatrix} -1\\\\ -2\\\\\\end{bmatrix}\\]\n(1) Find $T \\left(\\begin{bmatrix} 1\\\\ 0\\\\\\end{bmatrix}\\right)$ and $T \\left(\\begin{bmatrix} 0\\\\ 1\\\\\\end{bmatrix}\\right)$.\n\n(2) Let $A$ be the standard matrix of $T$, find $A$ and $A^{-1}$. \n\n(3) Let \\textbf{b} $= \\begin{bmatrix} 7\\\\ 9\\\\\\end{bmatrix}$, find all the vectors \\textbf{x} in $\\mathbb{R}^2$ such that $T(\\textbf{x}) = \\textbf{b}$. ",
